  << /ActualText (Led the Ads\054 Growth and AI tooling teams \055 launched a multi\055brand design system\054 consolidated a set of fragmented internal tools to create a cohesive operating system\054 and created zero\055to\055one experiences balancing cutting\055edge technology with journalistic integrity and user privacy\056 Helping Axios\047s position as a leader in modern digital news delivery\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
