  << /ActualText (I was CreativeX\047s first in\055house product design hire\056 I led the design of reporting tools\054 data gathering optimization for ML models\054 built the org\047s first design system\054 and formalized a set of best practices for design research within the org\056 I was also involved in scaling out product teams\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1183 0 R
