1184 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At Intuit\054 the goal was to help small businesses enter the \034omnichannel\035 while positioning Quickbooks to be the center of small business growth\056 I spent my time leading the design and research for their first \034zapier\055like\035 automation platform\056 The product connected the APIs of commonly used business apps to save countless working hours for small businesses\056 My work shipped and is now a premium feature in Quickbooks E\055Commerce \055 Intuit\031s newest venture after acquiring Trade Gecko\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1185 0 R
     /Pg 1166 0 R
     /S /Span
