1186 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I was responsible for the end\055to\055end experience of Prudential\031s \034robo\055advisor\056\035 Through a user research study that documented inefficiencies within the user onboarding\054 I instigated conversations with senior leadership that led to redesigning the consumer\055facing product that serves over two million users\056 The design team also extended my internship to be involved in work for the Prudential\056com taxonomy\054 PGIM redesign\054 Design System\054 Simple Cash Account\054 and A\057B testing of components\056 )
